ze="19" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" color="#14213D" textAlign="LEFT" fontStyle="BOLD" lineHeight="1.28" text="③ 放大成条纹"/></Positioned><Positioned left="682" top="1224" width="264" height="60"><Text fontSize="15" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" color="#4A4438" textAlign="LEFT" lineHeight="1.45" text="间距差沿垂直方向累积，\n粗条纹 = 6px ÷ sinθ"/></Positioned><Positioned left="40" top="1306" width="920" height="40"><SizedBox width="920" height="40"><DecoratedBox color="#E8EFD8" borderRadius="10"/></SizedBox></Positioned><Positioned left="56" top="1314" width="890" height="28"><Text fontSize="16" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" color="#2E5A38" textAlign="LEFT" fontStyle="BOLD" lineHeight="1.28" text="动手试：用一张纸片盖住上层栅再松开——条纹随之出现与消失，说明条纹来自两层的叠合而非印刷瑕疵。"/></Positioned><Positioned left="40" top="1356" width="920" height="18"><Text fontSize="12" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" color="#888888" textAlign="CENTER" lineHeight="1.28" text="展项为虚构演示；条纹间距按理想等距线栅的几何关系估算，实际观感随显示介质与观看距离变化"/></Positioned>
